sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Agent
    participant Orchestrator
    participant Etherfuse
    participant Stellar
    participant Circle

    User->>Agent: "Send R$1000 to US bank account"
    Agent->>Orchestrator: createTransfer(amount=1000, dest=US)
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: create_transfer_with_event() RPC
    Note over Orchestrator: CREATED

    Agent->>Agent: Get BRL/USDC quote from DEX
    Agent->>Orchestrator: attachQuote(rate=4.92)
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: transition_transfer()
    Note over Orchestrator: QUOTED — \$203.09 expected

    Agent->>Etherfuse: Create PIX charge
    Etherfuse-->>Agent: BrCode + charge_id
    Agent->>Orchestrator: issuePixCharge(chargeId)
    Note over Orchestrator: PIX_CHARGE_ISSUED

    User->>Etherfuse: Pay PIX (sandbox)
    Etherfuse->>Agent: Webhook (e2e_id, paid_at)
    Agent->>Orchestrator: confirmPixFunding(evidence)
    Note over Orchestrator: PIX_FUNDED

    Agent->>Orchestrator: beginConversion()
    Note over Orchestrator: CONVERTING — R$1000 → 203.09 USDC

    Agent->>Stellar: Submit PATH_PAYMENT XLM→USDC
    Stellar-->>Agent: tx_hash: e0309ddf...
    loop Poll every 10s
        StellarSettlementWatcher->>Stellar: GET /transactions/:hash
        Stellar-->>StellarSettlementWatcher: successful, ledger 2488252
    end
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: confirmStellarSettlement()
    Note over Orchestrator: STELLAR_SETTLED

    Agent->>Orchestrator: routePayout(provider=circle)
    Note over Orchestrator: PAYOUT_ROUTING — same_name_check passed

    Orchestrator->>Circle: POST /v1/businessAccount/payouts
    Circle-->>Orchestrator: HTTP 201, payout_id, status pending
    Note over Orchestrator: PAYOUT_INSTRUCTED

    Note over Circle: ~10 min sandbox settlement
    Circle-->>Orchestrator: status: complete

    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: computeReconciliation()
    Note over Orchestrator: BRL in = USDC settled = USD out
    Note over Orchestrator: RECONCILED
